msgid "Coverage map"
msgstr "Versorgungskarte"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/app.py
msgid "Messages"
msgstr "Meldungen"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/app.py
msgid ""
"What plays through the room: the recording, and the source and listener of "
"the response it plays through"
msgstr ""
"Was durch den Raum wiedergegeben wird: die Aufnahme sowie Quelle und "
"Empfänger der dafür verwendeten Antwort"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/app.py
msgid "&New box room…"
msgstr "&Neuer Quaderraum…"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/app.py
msgid "Start a new scene in a box-shaped room"
msgstr "Eine neue Szene in einem quaderförmigen Raum erstellen"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/app.py
msgid "New from &model file…"
msgstr "Neu aus &Modelldatei…"

#: acoustic_spaces/gui/app.py
msgid "Start from a model file (OBJ, DXF, glTF, STL, IFC, Collada or SketchUp)"
msgstr ""
"Mit einer Modelldatei beginnen (OBJ, DXF, glTF, STL, IFC, Collada oder "
"SketchUp)"

